1
00:01:55,636 --> 00:01:56,145
Here.

2
00:01:56,247 --> 00:01:57,680
Some things already have owners.

3
00:01:57,796 --> 00:01:58,901
We shouldn’t touch them.

4
00:01:59,134 --> 00:02:00,210
Who is the owner?

5
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:03,410
Giving time...

6
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:05,367
is giving a part of your life.

7
00:02:05,643 --> 00:02:06,734
It's a shame...

8
00:02:07,803 --> 00:02:09,323
that the watch has stopped.

9
00:02:10,312 --> 00:02:11,534
I really love it here.

10
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:12,465
Staying...

11
00:02:12,545 --> 00:02:13,920
just feels incredibly right.

12
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,389
But I think

13
00:02:15,621 --> 00:02:16,560
here's...

14
00:02:16,654 --> 00:02:18,094
a bit creepy.

15
00:02:18,305 --> 00:02:20,472
We just got here yesterday.

16
00:02:20,530 --> 00:02:22,574
It's too soon to tell if we'll like it.

17
00:02:24,014 --> 00:02:24,938
Trust me.

18
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:26,520
Peekaboo!

19
00:02:31,410 --> 00:02:32,065
Sir!

20
00:02:38,050 --> 00:02:39,018
Thank you so much.

21
00:02:55,483 --> 00:02:56,247
Peekaboo!

22
00:03:02,741 --> 00:03:04,334
Why did they curse us?

23
00:03:04,450 --> 00:03:05,818
They hated your ancestors.

24
00:03:06,210 --> 00:03:07,709
Aren’t they part of my family?

25
00:03:08,487 --> 00:03:09,854
Find that out for yourself.

26
00:03:10,654 --> 00:03:12,225
My friend wrote to me...

27
00:03:12,392 --> 00:03:14,669
there's a vacancy
at the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.

28
00:03:15,032 --> 00:03:16,480
That's a relief.

29
00:03:16,967 --> 00:03:18,843
You must marry Bu-nga...

30
00:03:19,010 --> 00:03:20,647
before you leave for the capital.

31
00:03:21,112 --> 00:03:23,018
Mother will never ask for her hand.

32
00:03:23,556 --> 00:03:25,054
Then you’ll have to elope.

33
00:03:31,934 --> 00:03:33,010
Bu-nga is my wife.

34
00:03:34,152 --> 00:03:36,952
He's sending his parents to propose.

35
00:03:37,709 --> 00:03:39,098
It won't be that easy.

36
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:48,370
They must rot in pain...

37
00:03:48,865 --> 00:03:49,709
and drown in misery.

38
00:03:50,305 --> 00:03:51,403
Left with nothing.

39
00:03:51,745 --> 00:03:53,461
Just as they did to us.

40
00:04:18,661 --> 00:04:19,338
Hey!

41
00:04:21,010 --> 00:04:21,825
Are you okay?

42
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:25,585
Are you hurt?

43
00:04:52,138 --> 00:04:53,069
Can I help you?

44
00:05:01,803 --> 00:05:02,545
It's alright.

45
00:05:02,632 --> 00:05:03,309
Thanks a lot.

46
00:05:03,614 --> 00:05:04,298
Sure.

47
00:05:08,632 --> 00:05:13,272
WORATHEP

48
00:05:20,967 --> 00:05:24,021
WORATHEP

49
00:05:24,727 --> 00:05:26,320
This piece is for honey.

50
00:05:26,385 --> 00:05:28,414
- Yes.
- Fifth-month honey. Good job!

51
00:05:29,294 --> 00:05:32,225
Now, look at the font.
What’s the vibe?

52
00:05:33,185 --> 00:05:36,778
As for the packaging...

53
00:05:36,952 --> 00:05:39,720
- does it make you want to buy it?
- Yes.

54
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:01,956
Come on, you know this.
The product should...

55
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:04,858
- have that "wow" factor.
- Got it.

56
00:06:04,930 --> 00:06:05,789
- Right?
- Yes.

57
00:06:05,854 --> 00:06:07,556
Yeah.

58
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:08,814
Okay.

59
00:06:30,247 --> 00:06:30,749
Hello.

60
00:06:31,163 --> 00:06:31,803
Hello.

61
00:06:32,669 --> 00:06:33,963
Can I ask you a favor?

62
00:06:34,465 --> 00:06:35,127
Sure.

63
00:06:37,810 --> 00:06:38,574
Don't worry.

64
00:06:39,134 --> 00:06:40,858
Just take care of things on your end.

65
00:06:41,243 --> 00:06:42,130
Thanks a lot.

66
00:06:58,880 --> 00:06:59,418
Alright.

67
00:06:59,498 --> 00:07:00,305
Let's get you to a doctor.

68
00:07:02,087 --> 00:07:02,858
I'm fine.

69
00:07:03,665 --> 00:07:04,603
I’m just in shock.

70
00:07:06,967 --> 00:07:08,450
Just take me home.

71
00:07:26,181 --> 00:07:27,905
- This way.
- Oh, okay.

72
00:07:47,643 --> 00:07:48,443
Hello, Ploy?

73
00:07:49,018 --> 00:07:50,327
Did you see Jomthap?

74
00:07:53,127 --> 00:07:54,014
Thep?

75
00:07:54,261 --> 00:07:56,254
Jomthap said you had an accident.

76
00:07:56,516 --> 00:07:57,687
Are you alright?

77
00:08:03,301 --> 00:08:04,770
I clipped a student with my car.

78
00:08:08,872 --> 00:08:09,425
Yeah.

79
00:08:09,549 --> 00:08:10,254
Ploy?

80
00:08:10,429 --> 00:08:11,141
Hello?

81
00:08:12,494 --> 00:08:13,178
Hello?

82
00:08:14,196 --> 00:08:15,047
Thep?

83
00:08:17,345 --> 00:08:18,029
Thep?

84
00:08:18,349 --> 00:08:19,221
Can you hear me?

85
00:08:19,490 --> 00:08:20,116
Ploy?

86
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,429
Hello?

87
00:08:32,443 --> 00:08:33,432
Is the signal bad?

88
00:08:33,992 --> 00:08:34,610
Yeah.

89
00:08:34,785 --> 00:08:36,785
I hear music in the background.

90
00:08:40,509 --> 00:08:41,607
It’s a Nora song.

91
00:08:45,432 --> 00:08:46,501
What did you say?

92
00:09:26,050 --> 00:09:27,330
Don't forget to submit your work tonight.

93
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,534
There's still a lot I don't understand.

94
00:10:16,050 --> 00:10:17,541
Can I ask you more about it tonight?

95
00:10:18,989 --> 00:10:19,570
Sure.

96
00:11:05,381 --> 00:11:07,047
On my way to pick you up,

97
00:11:07,163 --> 00:11:08,734
I hit a student with my car.

98
00:11:10,058 --> 00:11:11,367
She refused to go to the hospital...

99
00:11:11,760 --> 00:11:13,396
insisting she was fine.

100
00:11:13,890 --> 00:11:15,280
She just wanted me to take her home.

101
00:11:17,367 --> 00:11:19,447
You should have insisted more.

102
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:23,549
I didn't want to bother her.

103
00:11:24,181 --> 00:11:25,534
She’s a bit strange.

104
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,152
I wouldn't call her scary,

105
00:11:28,916 --> 00:11:29,970
not exactly.

106
00:11:30,261 --> 00:11:31,723
It seems better to stay away.

107
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:33,585
It's hard to explain.

108
00:11:42,850 --> 00:11:44,152
It's me.

109
00:11:47,447 --> 00:11:48,509
Who's "me"?

110
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:55,061
The student who had questions tonight.

111
00:11:57,505 --> 00:11:58,320
Oh, right!

112
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,847
I'll get you some coffee.

113
00:12:20,640 --> 00:12:21,716
How are you feeling?

114
00:12:23,534 --> 00:12:24,894
Does anything hurt?

115
00:12:31,956 --> 00:12:32,749
No.

116
00:12:33,709 --> 00:12:34,989
Can we talk?

117
00:12:44,472 --> 00:12:45,701
Which part do you need me to explain?

118
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,774
From the start.

119
00:13:27,847 --> 00:13:28,618
This one.

120
00:13:29,330 --> 00:13:30,145
Right here.

121
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:35,076
This one first.

122
00:13:35,963 --> 00:13:36,465
Here.

123
00:13:36,567 --> 00:13:37,127
See?

124
00:13:38,050 --> 00:13:38,800
Do you know it?

125
00:13:40,901 --> 00:13:41,927
Chanchao

126
00:13:43,250 --> 00:13:44,625
Did you have fun?

127
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:46,269
I did.

128
00:13:46,807 --> 00:13:48,152
Time for bed soon.

129
00:13:49,709 --> 00:13:50,443
Okay.

130
00:13:51,061 --> 00:13:51,832
Alright?

131
00:13:53,105 --> 00:13:54,109
Got it.

132
00:13:56,029 --> 00:13:56,530
Come on.

133
00:14:16,167 --> 00:14:17,418
It's due at midnight.

134
00:14:17,570 --> 00:14:18,581
Better hurry up.

135
00:15:42,916 --> 00:15:43,643
Ouch!

136
00:15:52,407 --> 00:15:53,265
Step back.

137
00:15:54,029 --> 00:15:54,712
Back up.

138
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:57,621
Let me see.

139
00:16:06,094 --> 00:16:07,287
Thank you.

140
00:16:20,909 --> 00:16:22,130
Ow, ouch!

141
00:16:24,145 --> 00:16:25,614
If cleaning a wound hurts this much,

142
00:16:26,021 --> 00:16:27,120
just let me die.

143
00:16:34,698 --> 00:16:35,440
Thep

144
00:16:40,618 --> 00:16:41,476
There you are.

145
00:16:42,792 --> 00:16:44,720
I brought some fruit for Bu-nga.

146
00:16:51,214 --> 00:16:52,123
What's wrong with your hand?

147
00:17:11,047 --> 00:17:11,774
Thep!

148
00:17:11,898 --> 00:17:12,792
Where are you going?

149
00:17:12,945 --> 00:17:14,996
To shut those people up.

150
00:17:16,123 --> 00:17:17,032
Please, don’t.

151
00:17:18,989 --> 00:17:20,196
They'll find out...

152
00:17:20,414 --> 00:17:22,712
that you're truly my husband.

153
00:17:27,207 --> 00:17:28,989
I'm so useless.

154
00:17:29,934 --> 00:17:32,167
I can't even protect my family.

155
00:17:36,552 --> 00:17:38,661
Have you told your parents...

156
00:17:39,338 --> 00:17:40,552
about the baby and me?

157
00:18:02,349 --> 00:18:04,574
My friend visited Chumphon

158
00:18:04,749 --> 00:18:06,290
and brought back some young coconut shells.

159
00:18:07,120 --> 00:18:10,989
I heard you make the best curry with them.

160
00:18:11,694 --> 00:18:13,309
I was hoping you could teach me.

161
00:18:15,745 --> 00:18:16,770
Oh my, Khem.

162
00:18:16,952 --> 00:18:18,509
He shouldn't have gotten her pregnant.

163
00:18:18,996 --> 00:18:19,992
Then why...

164
00:18:20,254 --> 00:18:22,145
didn't you try to stop him?

165
00:18:22,603 --> 00:18:24,720
You live under the same roof.

166
00:18:24,981 --> 00:18:26,014
Well,

167
00:18:26,109 --> 00:18:28,501
word's going around the market.

168
00:18:28,683 --> 00:18:30,109
She actually has Thep's child.

169
00:18:30,290 --> 00:18:30,981
- What?
- What?

170
00:18:31,374 --> 00:18:32,000
That's right.

171
00:18:34,058 --> 00:18:36,109
Have you no gratitude?

172
00:18:36,654 --> 00:18:39,469
How dare you speak of your master like that!

173
00:18:40,167 --> 00:18:40,858
Well...

174
00:18:42,196 --> 00:18:45,018
the whole market is really talking.

175
00:18:45,192 --> 00:18:46,930
Gon, the fisherman,

176
00:18:47,018 --> 00:18:48,698
even confirmed it.

177
00:18:48,850 --> 00:18:50,000
He said he saw

178
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:51,454
Thep and

179
00:18:51,752 --> 00:18:52,647
Bu-nga

180
00:18:52,807 --> 00:18:53,832
at a cottage.

181
00:18:54,421 --> 00:18:58,349
Who else could the father be?

182
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:00,472
If it's not...

183
00:19:00,603 --> 00:19:02,298
And you believe them?

184
00:19:04,625 --> 00:19:06,378
I think they all know...

185
00:19:06,690 --> 00:19:08,640
Bu-nga and Khem are inseparable.

186
00:19:09,047 --> 00:19:10,538
If she is really pregnant,

187
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:12,625
it has to be Khem’s.

188
00:19:14,363 --> 00:19:16,087
Please don't worry about it.

189
00:20:04,872 --> 00:20:06,349
Who’s upset you, Mother?

190
00:20:10,530 --> 00:20:12,574
My own flesh and blood.
Everyone knows by now...

191
00:20:12,836 --> 00:20:14,341
that you're with that woman.

192
00:20:18,190 --> 00:20:19,636
Since you already know...

193
00:20:23,098 --> 00:20:24,589
I'm here to beg you.

194
00:20:25,170 --> 00:20:26,858
Please ask for her hand in marriage

195
00:20:27,061 --> 00:20:27,949
as soon as you can.

196
00:20:31,294 --> 00:20:32,218
Thep!

197
00:20:33,985 --> 00:20:35,549
You lowered yourself for her

198
00:20:35,854 --> 00:20:37,534
and I chose to ignore.

199
00:20:38,152 --> 00:20:39,985
And now you want to marry her?

200
00:20:41,229 --> 00:20:42,974
What about my reputation?

201
00:20:46,887 --> 00:20:48,610
I got her pregnant. If I leave her,

202
00:20:49,316 --> 00:20:51,083
people will talk.

203
00:20:54,420 --> 00:20:55,643
How do you even know...

204
00:20:55,912 --> 00:20:57,767
the baby is yours?

205
00:20:58,400 --> 00:21:00,901
She's always been with Khem,

206
00:21:01,061 --> 00:21:03,280
and out dancing for hire.

207
00:21:03,883 --> 00:21:04,552
You really think...

208
00:21:04,669 --> 00:21:06,043
she hasn't slept around?

209
00:21:07,156 --> 00:21:09,003
I trust my wife.

210
00:21:11,585 --> 00:21:13,221
How dare you call her your wife!

211
00:21:14,520 --> 00:21:15,556
I truly love her.

212
00:21:28,021 --> 00:21:30,749
She will never be my daughter-in-law.

213
00:21:31,861 --> 00:21:33,556
Get ready to leave for the capital.

214
00:21:33,963 --> 00:21:35,570
Your father is going with you.

215
00:22:03,381 --> 00:22:05,040
Just as I thought.

216
00:22:09,578 --> 00:22:11,010
Honestly, I didn't want to elope.

217
00:22:13,265 --> 00:22:14,960
I wanted to respect her and her father.

218
00:22:17,047 --> 00:22:18,087
More importantly,

219
00:22:19,258 --> 00:22:20,756
Bu-nga is pregnant.

220
00:22:21,541 --> 00:22:22,829
It could be hard on her.

221
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:28,807
We had no choice.

222
00:22:30,472 --> 00:22:32,741
Her belly keeps growing.

223
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:36,538
With your skills,

224
00:22:37,192 --> 00:22:38,509
you'll make it anywhere.

225
00:22:40,923 --> 00:22:42,014
Once the baby is born,

226
00:22:42,494 --> 00:22:43,978
come back and ask for forgiveness.

227
00:22:44,705 --> 00:22:46,327
They won't be able to resist a grandchild.

228
00:22:55,280 --> 00:22:56,829
I’m completely lost right now.

229
00:22:57,614 --> 00:22:59,672
I don’t even know where to begin.

230
00:23:05,709 --> 00:23:06,836
I'll help you.

231
00:23:36,923 --> 00:23:39,098
This worries me even more.

232
00:23:40,836 --> 00:23:42,923
I hate leaving you alone with the kid.

233
00:23:48,974 --> 00:23:50,996
I wasn’t going crazy.

234
00:23:52,240 --> 00:23:54,734
It felt like something took over.

235
00:24:01,592 --> 00:24:02,989
You’re just exhausted...

236
00:24:04,138 --> 00:24:05,214
and under so much stress.

237
00:24:07,309 --> 00:24:08,545
I'll go get your medicine.

238
00:24:26,065 --> 00:24:28,472
I'll ask Jomthap to stay here

239
00:24:29,032 --> 00:24:30,480
during the renovations.

240
00:24:32,654 --> 00:24:34,756
It's better to have someone here

241
00:24:35,010 --> 00:24:36,189
with you and the child.

242
00:25:15,105 --> 00:25:15,570
Oh,

243
00:25:15,665 --> 00:25:16,240
hello.

244
00:25:17,141 --> 00:25:18,530
Are you looking for someone?

245
00:25:19,141 --> 00:25:20,589
I'm here to see the fortune teller.

246
00:25:21,825 --> 00:25:22,705
Well,

247
00:25:22,858 --> 00:25:25,796
he just left not long before you arrived.

248
00:25:26,130 --> 00:25:27,476
He shouldn't be far.

249
00:25:28,167 --> 00:25:29,047
You can wait here.

250
00:25:29,920 --> 00:25:30,814
Thank you.

251
00:25:35,185 --> 00:25:37,018
Come on. Let's go wait up there.

252
00:25:54,341 --> 00:25:55,621
What can I do...

253
00:25:55,912 --> 00:25:56,981
if I can't sell it?

254
00:26:00,334 --> 00:26:01,418
Keep it for the owner.

255
00:26:06,210 --> 00:26:07,403
Is that my duty?

256
00:26:09,090 --> 00:26:10,378
You know it is.

257
00:26:13,010 --> 00:26:15,265
I believe the owner's
already reached out to you.

258
00:26:20,145 --> 00:26:21,338
I had a weird dream.

259
00:26:22,443 --> 00:26:23,665
I've never had a dream like that before.

260
00:26:26,050 --> 00:26:27,425
I saw myself.

261
00:26:28,356 --> 00:26:29,338
Not as I am now.

262
00:26:31,163 --> 00:26:32,603
But I know it was me.

263
00:26:34,210 --> 00:26:35,483
I was with a woman.

264
00:26:43,578 --> 00:26:44,785
Could she be the owner?

265
00:26:52,298 --> 00:26:53,396
If I find her

266
00:26:54,778 --> 00:26:55,869
and return it to her,

267
00:26:56,698 --> 00:26:58,938
I won't die young like the others, right?

268
00:27:07,032 --> 00:27:08,312
The time of death

269
00:27:09,389 --> 00:27:10,632
is determined by our karma.

270
00:28:13,738 --> 00:28:14,516
Mom.

271
00:28:15,178 --> 00:28:15,854
Yes?

272
00:28:17,272 --> 00:28:18,283
I'm hungry.

273
00:28:19,323 --> 00:28:19,825
Okay.

274
00:28:28,276 --> 00:28:30,334
If it's bad,

275
00:28:30,530 --> 00:28:31,934
don't take it with you.

276
00:28:32,007 --> 00:28:33,614
Go burn it over there.

277
00:28:41,287 --> 00:28:44,210
Foes from former lives shall return,

278
00:28:44,690 --> 00:28:48,225
Bringing despair and the urge to flee.

279
00:28:48,640 --> 00:28:52,080
Persevere in your righteous deeds.

280
00:28:52,392 --> 00:28:56,334
To shield your life from certain death.

281
00:29:05,738 --> 00:29:07,360
I hope it's not too late.

282
00:29:12,283 --> 00:29:13,098
Chanchao.

283
00:29:13,294 --> 00:29:13,956
Let's go.

284
00:29:14,712 --> 00:29:15,323
Come here.

285
00:29:55,163 --> 00:29:56,538
What a smooth edit.

286
00:29:56,945 --> 00:29:57,512
You...

287
00:29:57,854 --> 00:29:59,600
You must be at the top of the class.

288
00:30:01,149 --> 00:30:02,567
Give me an A+, Professor.

289
00:30:02,654 --> 00:30:03,338
Well,

290
00:30:04,196 --> 00:30:06,261
keep it up in two days
and you’ll outdo me.

291
00:30:12,094 --> 00:30:12,938
This is really good.

292
00:30:13,090 --> 00:30:14,058
Great job.

293
00:30:35,410 --> 00:30:36,472
Even if you skip class,

294
00:30:37,527 --> 00:30:39,127
please make sure to turn in your work.

295
00:31:00,654 --> 00:31:01,672
As for this one,

296
00:31:01,796 --> 00:31:03,592
it needs a lot more detail

297
00:31:03,840 --> 00:31:05,934
to make it clearer.

298
00:31:06,610 --> 00:31:07,876
Keep working on it.

299
00:31:08,385 --> 00:31:09,010
Alright.

300
00:31:09,832 --> 00:31:10,545
What's this?

301
00:31:10,836 --> 00:31:11,883
- Professor.
- Yes.

302
00:31:12,458 --> 00:31:12,916
Yes?

303
00:31:12,996 --> 00:31:14,247
- Oh, just hand it in now?
- Yes.

304
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:15,483
Okay.

305
00:31:15,541 --> 00:31:16,836
This looks like your friend's.

306
00:31:17,694 --> 00:31:18,661
You didn't copy?

307
00:31:18,785 --> 00:31:19,069
Okay.

308
00:31:19,134 --> 00:31:20,516
- Yours is a toddy palm too.
- Yes.

309
00:31:20,574 --> 00:31:22,465
Why don't you add the same details?

310
00:31:22,545 --> 00:31:23,803
Look. There's no...

311
00:31:23,970 --> 00:31:24,501
like...

312
00:31:24,676 --> 00:31:26,865
...color details.
Why isn't it detailed like theirs?

313
00:31:27,010 --> 00:31:28,472
A total coincidence?

314
00:31:28,901 --> 00:31:29,898
I see.

315
00:31:30,152 --> 00:31:32,130
Anyway, keep working on it.

316
00:31:33,767 --> 00:31:35,796
Make it look more like a palm.

317
00:31:36,167 --> 00:31:36,727
See?

318
00:31:36,792 --> 00:31:37,949
This looks very commercial.

319
00:32:33,440 --> 00:32:34,130
Excuse me.

320
00:32:34,610 --> 00:32:35,447
- Yes?
- Well...

321
00:32:35,992 --> 00:32:37,810
My student was here earlier.

322
00:32:37,978 --> 00:32:39,214
She wasn't feeling well.

323
00:32:39,912 --> 00:32:40,720
Is she alright?

324
00:32:42,538 --> 00:32:44,123
There's no one in there.

325
00:32:44,370 --> 00:32:45,505
No one?

326
00:32:45,665 --> 00:32:46,218
That's right.

327
00:32:46,683 --> 00:32:47,621
Are you sure?

328
00:32:48,007 --> 00:32:48,618
Yes.

329
00:32:48,800 --> 00:32:51,105
I just cleaned it.

330
00:32:52,247 --> 00:32:52,952
I see.

331
00:32:53,410 --> 00:32:54,167
Thank you.

332
00:32:54,247 --> 00:32:54,850
You're welcome.

333
00:34:24,727 --> 00:34:25,578
Mom.

334
00:34:26,210 --> 00:34:27,665
I want to go look inside.

335
00:34:29,840 --> 00:34:30,829
Chanchao, wait...

336
00:34:31,665 --> 00:34:32,523
Hello.

337
00:34:32,640 --> 00:34:33,745
May we go inside?

338
00:34:33,810 --> 00:34:35,403
- I'm going in!
- Chanchao, wait.

339
00:34:43,760 --> 00:34:44,872
I’m so sorry.

340
00:34:45,076 --> 00:34:45,556
It's just that...

341
00:34:45,629 --> 00:34:47,265
she really wants to see inside.

342
00:34:47,323 --> 00:34:48,472
No trouble at all.

343
00:34:48,938 --> 00:34:49,709
Go right ahead.

344
00:34:49,781 --> 00:34:51,541
- Sorry for the intrusion.
- Not at all.

345
00:35:07,200 --> 00:35:08,320
Hello there.

346
00:35:08,494 --> 00:35:10,261
- Hello.
- Is this your first time?

347
00:35:10,610 --> 00:35:10,974
Yes.

348
00:35:11,040 --> 00:35:12,814
My daughter wanted to have a look.

349
00:35:13,352 --> 00:35:15,120
She can take classes if she's interested.

350
00:35:15,207 --> 00:35:17,105
We have classes on weekends.

351
00:35:17,265 --> 00:35:19,570
But Prof. Niyom has an interview today.

352
00:35:19,774 --> 00:35:21,418
The students are here to help out.

353
00:35:21,752 --> 00:35:22,305
Oh,

354
00:35:22,436 --> 00:35:23,178
I see.

355
00:35:23,483 --> 00:35:24,865
Sorry for the trouble.

356
00:37:13,032 --> 00:37:15,527
She dances well
for someone with no training.

357
00:37:15,709 --> 00:37:17,556
She's very talented.

358
00:37:19,054 --> 00:37:21,403
She probably just mimicked the others.

359
00:37:23,287 --> 00:37:24,254
In that case,

360
00:37:25,330 --> 00:37:27,600
she should definitely take a class.

361
00:37:32,320 --> 00:37:34,232
Thank you for your kindness.

362
00:37:37,018 --> 00:37:38,152
I want to come here!

363
00:37:39,774 --> 00:37:41,338
Please let me join, Mom.

364
00:37:44,770 --> 00:37:47,614
Thank you so much for today.

365
00:37:49,425 --> 00:37:50,029
Let's go.

366
00:38:14,261 --> 00:38:16,109
I’m back. I saw that...

367
00:38:16,181 --> 00:38:18,465
the scaffolding is all finished.

368
00:38:18,676 --> 00:38:19,476
And...

369
00:38:19,527 --> 00:38:20,749
I'm making dinner tonight.

370
00:38:20,792 --> 00:38:21,832
Don't bother buying anything.

371
00:38:21,905 --> 00:38:23,112
Just come straight home.

372
00:38:24,530 --> 00:38:26,080
Okay, see you then.

373
00:38:34,421 --> 00:38:35,352
Mom.

374
00:38:41,585 --> 00:38:42,465
Mom.

375
00:38:51,956 --> 00:38:52,836
Chanchao!

376
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:54,625
Chanchao!

377
00:38:56,138 --> 00:38:56,894
Chanchao!

378
00:38:57,083 --> 00:38:58,341
Get down from there!

379
00:38:58,647 --> 00:38:58,887
Don't...

380
00:38:58,960 --> 00:39:01,410
...play around the workers.

381
00:39:02,378 --> 00:39:03,170
Chanchao,

382
00:39:04,487 --> 00:39:05,941
I’m coming up to get you.

383
00:39:06,283 --> 00:39:07,890
Stay right there, okay?

384
00:39:29,352 --> 00:39:30,058
Ploy!

385
00:39:30,174 --> 00:39:31,054
Watch out!

386
00:41:03,570 --> 00:41:04,938
Lady Mok sent this for you.

387
00:41:09,687 --> 00:41:10,887
Let me go with you.

388
00:41:13,301 --> 00:41:14,094
You can't.

389
00:41:14,567 --> 00:41:16,240
Too many people will draw attention.

390
00:41:18,283 --> 00:41:19,396
I’m not going on a vacation.

391
00:41:20,072 --> 00:41:21,869
If you come, it’ll only be harder.

392
00:41:23,490 --> 00:41:24,443
I don’t care.

393
00:41:24,640 --> 00:41:25,905
I’ll be of use to you.

394
00:41:38,690 --> 00:41:39,810
Give this to Bu-nga.

395
00:41:44,320 --> 00:41:45,767
Once I'm settled,

396
00:41:47,381 --> 00:41:48,749
I'll come back for you.

397
00:42:13,941 --> 00:42:14,858
We're a bit early.

398
00:43:28,530 --> 00:43:29,825
Or did Mr. Thep change his mind?

399
00:43:32,283 --> 00:43:33,214
No way.

400
00:43:39,258 --> 00:43:40,298
I’m worried that...

401
00:43:40,814 --> 00:43:42,589
something’s happened to him.

402
00:44:43,069 --> 00:44:44,225
If he doesn't show up,

403
00:44:45,272 --> 00:44:46,836
let's go to the capital together.

404
00:44:50,800 --> 00:44:51,818
No,

405
00:44:53,374 --> 00:44:54,894
I’m never leaving him.

406
00:45:05,440 --> 00:45:06,640
I may not be rich...

407
00:45:07,614 --> 00:45:09,090
but I can read and write.

408
00:45:10,501 --> 00:45:11,629
I can take care of you.

409
00:45:23,418 --> 00:45:24,058
But...

410
00:45:26,087 --> 00:45:27,701
I don’t want to be with you.

411
00:45:35,796 --> 00:45:36,436
Bu-nga

412
00:45:38,574 --> 00:45:40,072
We grew up together.

413
00:45:41,374 --> 00:45:43,200
Why pretend you don't know how I feel?

414
00:45:44,196 --> 00:45:45,170
Or maybe you know...

415
00:45:46,276 --> 00:45:47,425
and you’re just being cruel.

416
00:45:50,654 --> 00:45:51,723
What are you saying?

417
00:45:56,240 --> 00:45:57,040
I...

418
00:46:44,080 --> 00:46:44,749
Bu-nga

419
00:46:45,185 --> 00:46:45,716
Khem

420
00:47:23,752 --> 00:47:24,705
Mother. Father.

421
00:47:26,807 --> 00:47:28,683
I take full responsibility.

422
00:47:30,618 --> 00:47:32,472
Punish me if you must...

423
00:47:34,909 --> 00:47:36,712
but please, spare Bu-nga and Khem.

424
00:47:41,010 --> 00:47:42,480
This was all my doing.

425
00:47:46,596 --> 00:47:47,374
What a pity.

426
00:47:49,330 --> 00:47:51,432
I sent you abroad to be educated,

427
00:47:53,665 --> 00:47:56,530
only for you to act like their servant.

428
00:47:57,163 --> 00:47:58,698
You are my eldest son.

429
00:48:01,440 --> 00:48:03,832
You have an estate to inherit

430
00:48:04,683 --> 00:48:07,200
...and a name to uphold.

431
00:48:08,596 --> 00:48:10,836
Yet you’ve thrown it all away.

432
00:48:12,254 --> 00:48:13,600
I am deeply disappointed.

433
00:48:19,338 --> 00:48:20,254
I'm sorry.

434
00:48:23,505 --> 00:48:24,596
Since...

435
00:48:25,403 --> 00:48:27,265
things have come to this,

436
00:48:29,498 --> 00:48:31,360
there is no other choice...

437
00:48:33,614 --> 00:48:34,458
but to...

438
00:48:35,650 --> 00:48:37,490
do the right thing.

439
00:48:54,290 --> 00:48:56,021
No one is going anywhere.

440
00:48:56,458 --> 00:48:58,000
Including your wife.

441
00:49:02,000 --> 00:49:03,789
She will move in with us.

442
00:50:30,341 --> 00:50:31,418
Come, choose a ring.

443
00:50:49,832 --> 00:50:51,090
If you choose a ring that small,

444
00:50:51,360 --> 00:50:53,040
people will look down on me.

445
00:51:03,440 --> 00:51:04,618
Take this one.

446
00:51:12,450 --> 00:51:14,298
We’ll start with a private ceremony.

447
00:51:15,505 --> 00:51:16,349
Bu-nga,

448
00:51:16,880 --> 00:51:18,225
you have to understand.

449
00:51:18,698 --> 00:51:20,043
It’s all so sudden.

450
00:51:21,047 --> 00:51:22,887
I can't prepare a wedding in time.

451
00:51:23,992 --> 00:51:26,094
You’ve been more than kind.

452
00:51:35,985 --> 00:51:37,221
Put the ring on your wife.

453
00:52:06,567 --> 00:52:08,560
Once Thep is established,

454
00:52:09,512 --> 00:52:11,570
we’ll hold a proper wedding.

455
00:52:33,330 --> 00:52:34,756
I’ll only love you.

456
00:52:34,930 --> 00:52:35,861
I promise.

457
00:52:39,381 --> 00:52:40,567
That Bu-nga...

458
00:52:40,763 --> 00:52:42,894
certainly has a way with men.

459
00:52:43,192 --> 00:52:44,014
No wonder

460
00:52:44,116 --> 00:52:46,392
he’s completely head over heels.

461
00:52:46,974 --> 00:52:48,545
What will you do now?

462
00:52:51,360 --> 00:52:52,923
The Lady insists you stay here

463
00:52:53,047 --> 00:52:55,149
until the baby is born.

464
00:52:58,087 --> 00:53:00,181
If I weren't the official wife,

465
00:53:00,487 --> 00:53:02,763
I'd never let my husband go so far.

466
00:53:02,880 --> 00:53:05,425
There are many beautiful women out there.

467
00:53:13,483 --> 00:53:14,472
I've been here before.

468
00:53:17,767 --> 00:53:18,850
My home.

469
00:53:22,094 --> 00:53:24,240
I curse every last one of you!

470
00:53:25,520 --> 00:53:28,312
May you be ruined for eternity.
